{
  "story_id": "fox-north-wind",
  "chapter": 2,
  "total_duration_ms": 190344,
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "In the morning, Nell told Farmor about the tracks.",
      "start_ms": 1749,
      "end_ms": 5117
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Farmor did not seem surprised.",
      "start_ms": 5117,
      "end_ms": 7125
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "She stood at the window with her cup of coffee and looked out at the snow.",
      "start_ms": 7125,
      "end_ms": 11983
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "The wind was still blowing.",
      "start_ms": 11983,
      "end_ms": 13861
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "\"Two nights,\" she said, quietly.",
      "start_ms": 13861,
      "end_ms": 15998
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "\"If it goes another night, the fox will come.\"",
      "start_ms": 15998,
      "end_ms": 19107
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "\"Farmor, do you really believe in it?",
      "start_ms": 19107,
      "end_ms": 21569
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "The story?\"",
      "start_ms": 21569,
      "end_ms": 22411
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Her grandmother was quiet for a moment.",
      "start_ms": 22411,
      "end_ms": 25066
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "\"I believe,\" she said, \"that some things are true even if they cannot be explained.",
      "start_ms": 25066,
      "end_ms": 30507
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "And I believe that some things are true because we agree to keep them true.\"",
      "start_ms": 30507,
      "end_ms": 35559
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "That afternoon, Farmor went to a drawer in the kitchen and took out a very small wooden box.",
      "start_ms": 35559,
      "end_ms": 41648
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "It was old.",
      "start_ms": 41648,
      "end_ms": 42425
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "The lid did not quite fit.",
      "start_ms": 42425,
      "end_ms": 44174
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Farmor blew on it and dust rose.",
      "start_ms": 44174,
      "end_ms": 46376
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "\"This,\" she said, \"is the offering box.",
      "start_ms": 46376,
      "end_ms": 48967
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "My father kept it here.",
      "start_ms": 48967,
      "end_ms": 50521
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "When the wind blew three nights, we put the gift inside, and we put the box on the doorstep at midnight.\"",
      "start_ms": 50521,
      "end_ms": 57452
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "She opened the box.",
      "start_ms": 57452,
      "end_ms": 58747
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "It was empty.",
      "start_ms": 58747,
      "end_ms": 59719
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "\"Farmor.",
      "start_ms": 59719,
      "end_ms": 60302
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "Do you have a gift ready?\"",
      "start_ms": 60302,
      "end_ms": 62115
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Her grandmother sighed.",
      "start_ms": 62115,
      "end_ms": 63670
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "She sat down at the kitchen table.",
      "start_ms": 63670,
      "end_ms": 66002
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "\"That is the trouble,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 66002,
      "end_ms": 68139
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "\"My father was the last one who knew the craft.",
      "start_ms": 68139,
      "end_ms": 71248
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "He knew what to give.",
      "start_ms": 71248,
      "end_ms": 72673
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "Since then — the wind has come three nights only twice in my life.",
      "start_ms": 72673,
      "end_ms": 77013
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "Once when I was young.",
      "start_ms": 77013,
      "end_ms": 78503
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Once when your mother was small.\"",
      "start_ms": 78503,
      "end_ms": 80770
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "\"And what did you give?\"",
      "start_ms": 80770,
      "end_ms": 82454
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "\"The first time, I panicked.",
      "start_ms": 82454,
      "end_ms": 84332
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "I gave a gold necklace.",
      "start_ms": 84332,
      "end_ms": 85886
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "It was expensive.",
      "start_ms": 85886,
      "end_ms": 87052
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "It felt important.\"",
      "start_ms": 87052,
      "end_ms": 88413
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "\"What happened?\"",
      "start_ms": 88413,
      "end_ms": 89578
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "\"The fox came,\" said Farmor slowly.",
      "start_ms": 89578,
      "end_ms": 91910
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "\"It stood on the doorstep.",
      "start_ms": 91910,
      "end_ms": 93659
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "It looked at the necklace.",
      "start_ms": 93659,
      "end_ms": 95408
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "It looked at me.",
      "start_ms": 95408,
      "end_ms": 96509
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "And it left, without taking anything.\"",
      "start_ms": 96509,
      "end_ms": 99100
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "She looked at Nell.",
      "start_ms": 99100,
      "end_ms": 100460
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "\"I did not understand what I had done wrong.",
      "start_ms": 100460,
      "end_ms": 103375
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "But I knew I had done something wrong.",
      "start_ms": 103375,
      "end_ms": 105901
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "The next morning, my father's silver ring — the one he wore his whole life — was missing.",
      "start_ms": 105901,
      "end_ms": 111730
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "We looked for it for weeks.",
      "start_ms": 111730,
      "end_ms": 113544
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "We never found it.\"",
      "start_ms": 113544,
      "end_ms": 114904
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Nell felt the hairs on her arms stand up.",
      "start_ms": 114904,
      "end_ms": 117624
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "\"So the story is real.\"",
      "start_ms": 117624,
      "end_ms": 119244
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "\"The story is real,\" said Farmor.",
      "start_ms": 119244,
      "end_ms": 121446
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "\"But I never learned how to give.\"",
      "start_ms": 121446,
      "end_ms": 123648
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Nell thought about this all afternoon while she helped Farmor bake.",
      "start_ms": 123648,
      "end_ms": 127687
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "She thought about it while they ate soup for lunch.",
      "start_ms": 127687,
      "end_ms": 130775
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "She thought about it while the wind kept blowing — hour after hour, without stopping.",
      "start_ms": 130775,
      "end_ms": 135942
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "\"Farmor,\" she said eventually.",
      "start_ms": 135942,
      "end_ms": 137783
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "\"What was different about your grandfather?",
      "start_ms": 137783,
      "end_ms": 140396
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "The first time.",
      "start_ms": 140396,
      "end_ms": 141346
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "What did he do that worked?\"",
      "start_ms": 141346,
      "end_ms": 143128
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Farmor stopped stirring the soup.",
      "start_ms": 143128,
      "end_ms": 145148
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "She looked at Nell, and her eyes were bright.",
      "start_ms": 145148,
      "end_ms": 147939
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "\"He was a sailor,\" she said.",
      "start_ms": 147939,
      "end_ms": 149661
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "\"He was cold and afraid and alone in the trees.",
      "start_ms": 149661,
      "end_ms": 152512
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "And on that first night — the night he was almost lost — he sang.",
      "start_ms": 152512,
      "end_ms": 156432
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "He sang to himself, to keep from being afraid.",
      "start_ms": 156432,
      "end_ms": 159223
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "He sang all the way through the forest.\"",
      "start_ms": 159223,
      "end_ms": 161718
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "\"And the fox heard the song,\" said Nell slowly.",
      "start_ms": 161718,
      "end_ms": 164628
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "\"The fox heard the song.",
      "start_ms": 164628,
      "end_ms": 166113
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "And came.\"",
      "start_ms": 166113,
      "end_ms": 166825
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "That night — the second night — the wind did not stop.",
      "start_ms": 166825,
      "end_ms": 170151
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "Nell went to bed but she could not sleep.",
      "start_ms": 170151,
      "end_ms": 172646
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "She listened to the wind.",
      "start_ms": 172646,
      "end_ms": 174190
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "She thought about her Farmor as a young woman, panicking, choosing a gold necklace.",
      "start_ms": 174190,
      "end_ms": 179179
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "She thought about the silver ring that was never found.",
      "start_ms": 179179,
      "end_ms": 182564
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "And she thought about tomorrow.",
      "start_ms": 182564,
      "end_ms": 184464
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "The third night.",
      "start_ms": 184464,
      "end_ms": 185474
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "When the wind was still blowing.",
      "start_ms": 185474,
      "end_ms": 187493
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "By morning, she had decided what she would give.",
      "start_ms": 187493,
      "end_ms": 190344
    }
  ]
}